     `white-space: pre` with `overflow-x: visible`. A verbatim register
     transcription therefore refused to wrap and pushed the whole PAGE into
     horizontal scroll rather than its own box.

     MEASURED (5 Nov 2026, /people/mary-bayes-farrow-1875/, headless Chromium):
     documentElement.scrollWidth 639px against a 320px viewport; the <pre>
     itself was 615px of content inside a 272px box. Setting the three props
